        "For Indian degrees an IB or IGCSE qualification normally needs an equivalence certificate from the Association of Indian Universities. CUET-UG scores open central universities, and JEE Main or NEET-UG eligibility depends on the subjects taken and passed, so a Maihar student should read each exam's current bulletin before subject choices are fixed in Class 11. IIT Indore and IIM Indore lie in the same state.",
